---
// Simple static visualization of the live bake path concept
// Uses living-tokens for the future aesthetic
---

<div class="bake-rail">
  <div class="rail-header">
    <span class="title">Live Bake History</span>
    <span class="meta">Tree-walker + vwall ladder (concept)</span>
  </div>
  
  <div class="rail">
    <div class="node commit">Root</div>
    <div class="node">SAM Mask</div>
    <div class="node active">Brush Stroke #3</div>
    <div class="node">Adjustment (scoped)</div>
    <div class="node commit">Checkpoint v3</div>
  </div>
  
  <div class="note">
    Each node can produce a ladder entry (preview + full). 
    The walker only re-bakes dirty subtrees.
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .bake-rail {
    background: #0a0a0b;
    border: 1px solid var(--lc-line, #222);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 1rem;
    margin: 1rem 0;
    font-family: monospace;
  }
  .rail-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  .title { color: var(--lc-accent, #ff5b2e); font-weight: 600; }
  .meta { color: #666; }
  
  .rail {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    padding-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .node {
    white-space: nowrap;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    background: #1a1a1c;
    border: 1px solid #333;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
  .node.active {
    border-color: var(--lc-cyan, #00f0ff);
    background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.1);
  }
  .node.commit {
    border-color: var(--lc-amber, #ff9f1c);
    background: rgba(255, 159, 28, 0.1);
  }
  .note {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: #666;
    margin-top: 8px;
    border-top: 1px dashed #222;
    padding-top: 8px;
  }
</style>